Description: GNU Radio QT GUI sink for templated on-demand recording
 file_recorder_sink is a GNU Radio out-of-tree (OOT) Python block that
 provides a toolbar button for operator-driven recording of sample
 streams into templated files.
 .
 Filename templates support date, incremental counter, and
 flowgraph-variable substitution. Recording stops automatically when
 a configurable duration or file-size cap is reached. The block
 appears in GRC under the File Recorder category as "File Recorder
 Sink".
